{"id":"wb-7-1252","name":"荫家堂","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"荫家堂","text":"荫家堂位于湖南省邵东市杨桥镇清水村，建于清道光三年（1823年），是湖湘建筑的民居典范，被列为全国重点文物保护单位。\n荫家堂由清代米商巨贾申承述兄弟修建，规模庞大，共计有108间正屋，因此又被当地人称为“一百零八间”。荫家堂属于封建社会典型的深宅大院，历经百余年其整体结构仍保存完整。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8D%AB%E5%AE%B6%E5%A0%82","revisionId":92609138,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92609138","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/1a1b7bc842fd5f92bd4bbad6.jpg","title":"Yinjiatang.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yinjiatang.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/11/Yinjiatang.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"FreeePedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Yinjiatang","width":320,"height":240}}